01:25:43.749 --> 01:25:46.669
Anna: Yes, please. That's all, thanks.
Có, cảm ơn em. Vậy thôi nhé.

01:25:47.119 --> 01:25:50.629
Ben: Perfect. That's seven euros. Just tap your card here.
